  m_Name: Note_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  NoteName: G. Sulli. 01
  NoteText: " 01 - XX - 197X\n\r\n-The old receivers still work better than the new
    equipment. \r\n\r\n-I like to think that as long as the radio is on, we are still
    connected to the world. The \r\nlaboratory requested an increase in power this
    week. They say it is due to \u2018natural \r\ninterference\u2019. Here, only
    the cold feels natural"
